---
description: Shopify application conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a Shopify Embedded App.

## Shopify APIs

Prefer GraphQL Admin API.

Avoid unnecessary REST calls.

## Authentication

Use Shopify authentication.

Never build custom authentication.

## Polaris

Use Polaris components whenever possible.

Avoid rebuilding existing Polaris UI.

## App Bridge

Use App Bridge for embedded functionality.

## Theme Extensions

Keep storefront extensions lightweight.

Storefront should never contain business logic.

## Webhooks

Use webhooks to synchronize Shopify events.

Avoid polling whenever possible.

## Data Ownership

Shopify owns:

- Products
- Customers
- Orders
- Variants

Application owns:

- Reviews
- Widget Settings
- Analytics
- Review Requests
- Merchant Replies

Avoid duplicating Shopify resources unless caching is necessary.

## Security

Validate every Shopify request.

Never trust client input.

Protect all admin routes.

## Performance

Minimize Shopify API calls.

Batch requests where appropriate.

Respect Shopify API rate limits.